# Filenames: kebab-case

All new and renamed source files under `src/` (and project scripts) must use **kebab-case**.

- ✅ `engine-radio-group.tsx`, `use-frame-rate-monitor.ts`, `user-states-rows.ts`
- ❌ `EngineRadioGroup.tsx`, `useFrameRateMonitor.ts`, `userStatesRows.ts`

Exports stay idiomatic JS/TS (PascalCase components, camelCase hooks/functions). Only the **filename** is kebab-case.

Exceptions (do not rename): Expo Router `_layout.tsx` / `+*` / `index.*`, and generated `*.d.ts`.

Enforced by `unicorn/filename-case` in `.oxlintrc.json` (`bun run lint`).
